Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.02,0:00:01.40,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Everyone says\Nthe {\1c&H47C2FF&}superstore{\1c&HFFFFFF&}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:04.41,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}is the best place\Nto survive an outbreak.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.48,0:00:06.41,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Everyone else\Nsays it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.58,0:00:07.34,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Six a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.36,0:00:09.87,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Tess was unloading\Nat the back.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:10.09,0:00:11.62,S1_Chip,,0,0,813,,{\3c&HB6B39F&\4c&HB6B39F&}GUEST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.09,0:00:11.62,D1_Left,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Reports of attacks\Ndowntown.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:11.64,0:00:13.38,S1_Chip,,0,0,813,,{\3c&HB6B39F&\4c&HB6B39F&}GUEST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:13.38,D1_Left,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Officials say\Nstay indoors.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.60,0:00:15.06,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Minutes later,\Nthe manager
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:17.12,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}opened the doors\Nfor shelter.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.33,0:00:19.62,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}And the whole town\Ndrove in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:20.72,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Horns. Alarms.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.74,0:00:22.73,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Hundreds of people\Nshouting.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.04,0:00:25.80,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Tess knew this building\Nfrom the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.82,0:00:28.38,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}One {\1c&H47C2FF&}glass{\1c&HFFFFFF&} front.\NEight dock doors.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:28.60,0:00:31.24,S1_Chip,,0,0,813,,{\3c&HB6B39F&\4c&HB6B39F&}GUEST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.60,0:00:31.24,D1_Right,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Can you get us\N{\1c&H47C2FF&}out{\1c&HFFFFFF&} of here?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.46,0:00:33.18,N1_LaneB,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Inside: food for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.20,0:00:35.99,N1_LaneB,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Outside: a van,\Nand a road.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.21,0:00:37.87,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}No reversing.\NNo beeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:41.03,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}She rolled out the back,\Nlights off.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.25,0:00:41.97,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Behind her,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.99,0:00:44.77,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}the town was walking\Ntoward the {\1c&H47C2FF&}noise{\1c&HFFFFFF&}.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:47.63,0:00:50.27,S1_Chip,,0,0,813,,{\3c&HB6B39F&\4c&HB6B39F&}GUEST
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.63,0:00:50.27,D1_Right,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}We left the best\Nplace to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.59,0:00:52.49,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}Tess didn't need\Nthe superstore.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.51,0:00:54.23,N1_Narration,,0,0,0,,{\fad(83,0)}She'd been {\1c&H47C2FF&}driving{\1c&HFFFFFF&} one.
